    {
     "field": "note",
     "from": null,
     "to": "Unitree A2 page (checked 2026-11-17): standing 820 x 440 x 570 mm, 42 kg with battery (35 kg without), 12 joint motors, single battery 9000 mAh (453.6 Wh) and dual 18000 mAh (907.2 Wh) - the 907.2 Wh recorded is the dual-battery figure; walking load about 25 kg (ideally ~35 kg), standing load about 100 kg; battery life >5 h without load / >3 h with 25 kg (the 3 h recorded is the loaded figure); speed 0-3.7 m/s (up to ~5 m/s in special configuration); IP56 on A2, IP56-IP67 on A2 Pro. A2 Pro adds a second LiDAR and wireless-vector follow module."
    },
